&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://dev.to/99tools/stop-sending-entire-objects-in-your-patch-requests-theres-a-better-way-411o#comments" class="crayons-btn crayons-btn--s crayons-btn--ghost crayons-btn--icon-left flex items-center"&gt;
Comments


